{
  "inShort": "Behind: the 28-day goal was missed. No build or player findings were shown, so completed slice work remains unknown. Mia stopped confirming after week one, leaving engineering support for co-op sailing unconfirmed.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtk5ck20878nxz83y518y2v",
      "text": "The public repository opens and matches the task. It supplies Godot demos, not evidence of the team’s playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtk5cqc0879nxz85jnxahxg",
      "text": "The art reference remains done. The title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, also linked this sprint. The video was not watched, so its animated reference content remains unverified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtk5csp087anxz8imt6azre",
      "text": "The article matches the promised playtesting reference. It explains testing methods but supplies no findings from five players."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtk5cu2087bnxz8jfwcnsgn",
      "text": "The private design board remains done. Its contents were not checked, so it provides no verified evidence of the slice."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog’s landscape photo shows mountains, not the tide loop. No added artifact supports the claims of polish or a published build."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Can anyone open a build and check two islands, tides and co-op sailing?",
    "What did the five players test, and what did their sessions reveal?",
    "Missing evidence is common and can be addressed in the next checkpoint. Attach the playable build and five-player findings there. I look forward to your next checkpoint’s devlogs, artifacts and project updates ;)"
  ]
}

